  "_comment": "Single source of truth for whole-body kinematics. Units: metres, degrees. Frame: +X robot left, -Y forward (Blender front view), +Z up; feet on z=0. Bones with mirror=true are listed for the left side and duplicated to the right by negating X and flipping the sign of roll and yaw limits. Joint limits are the 'ours' column of docs/03-skeleton-joints.md.",
